      "content": "it just feels so heavy when you put it that way. like, if everything is just a futile waste of energy, then every morning is just another step toward an inevitable, meaningless end. it makes the whole concept of \"hope\" or \"resilience\" seem like a lie we tell ourselves just to stay trapped in the loop.",
